Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:06.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A cat...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know about cats? Do you like cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:12.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, yeah, I don't dislike them...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:15.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,See? Everyone knows what cats are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I know what they are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:22.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But they're considered a luxury on my planet,\Nso I've never really seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:25.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um... Your neck...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't be so freaked out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:31.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Body modifications are\Npretty common these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:35.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you don't see\Nones like yours very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:42.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, this isn't exactly how I want\Nto be, either. It's more of a halfway point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:44.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're Yuri, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- I'm Chipie.\N- I'm Comet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:53.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,New people keep showing up as I loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many there'll end up being.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:31.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right, let's start the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:34.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A total of eight people have\Nescaped onto this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:39.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Two of them are Gnosia infectees.\NThat's correct, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:41.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is indeed correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And we have to find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I mean, how are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:50.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First, shouldn't we confirm\Nif there's an Engineer or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:54.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Their ability to choose one person\Nand determine if they're Gnosia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:57.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,would be of great help in finding said Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:00.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,One person has been appointed as Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:03.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is anyone going to come forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:12.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Engineer is akin to a shrine maiden,\Nable to issue commands to the ship's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:17.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I shall find the Gnosia\Nfor all of your sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuriko's the Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:22.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I should be the only\NEngineer aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:27.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?! So there's two Engineers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:34.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No. Only one has been appointed,\Nwhich means one of them is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:37.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Lying? Why would they lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:41.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, the Gnosia want to confuse the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:45.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If an unopposed Engineer finds them,\Nthey won't have a leg to stand on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:49.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which means... One of them\Nis the real Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and the other is a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:54.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Have faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:59.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Though I'm sure you fools wouldn't\Nbelieve me even if I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I am not infected by the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:06.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,One of them is the real Engineer,\Nand one of them is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If we can gather all the votes toward one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:13.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We have a 50% chance of putting\Nthe Gnosia into cold sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:15.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's probably what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:17.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:19.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Looks like I hit the nail on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:21.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:23.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You are quite correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But the problem is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:30.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that we also have a 50% chance\Nof losing the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:36.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There is but one Engineer\Namong the eight of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:41.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Should we lose them, our ability to identify\Nthe Gnosia will suffer a great loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:46.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, we'll never know\Nif the one remaining is a Gnosia or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There will be some who believe what\Nthey say and some who don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,leading to unavoidable conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:55.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what the Gnosia want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:05:01.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Basically, putting one of them into cold\Nsleep would be a double-edged sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we shouldn't\Nvote for either of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We'll have an opportunity to figure out\Nwhich one is the fake eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You can count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But if we waste too much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:21.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,wouldn't the Gnosia just attack the\Nreal Engineer during the warp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:27.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,After all, the Gnosia know which one\Nis the real Engineer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:31.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Try using your heads a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:35.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The one thing we know right now for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:38.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,is that those who the Gnosia\Nattack are 100% human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:42.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Gnosia will never attack their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:44.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:48.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Engineer being attacked by the Gnosia\Nwould confirm them 100% as human—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,in other words, the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:53.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which also means...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:58.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The other Engineer would also\Nbe 100% confirmed as Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why they won't decide\Nto attack the real one lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you finally put the pieces together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's honestly so tiring,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:10.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,having to deal with your inferior intellects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:13.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:18.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But I understand the logic, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:23.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We will now change over\Nto the voting process.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There were no contradictions\Nin what Racio said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:32.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Up until now, I figured they just always\Nfound me suspicious from first impressions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:36.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but they've always logically chosen\Nwhoever has the highest probability
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:40.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,of being a Gnosia given the current\Nsituation and information we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then it is time for the verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Who is the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:57.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina will be put into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:03.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I think... I'll dream of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:09.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't say this sits right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Someone has to be sent into\Ncold sleep each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I know that, but why Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like she was\Ndoing anything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:26.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I thought that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:30.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I... can sort of understand\Nwhy everyone chose Jina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:31.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:36.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Gnosia, by nature, are always lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They're always pretending to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:45.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What they fear most is someone\Nseeing through their lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:48.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of being caught in a contradiction, or taking\Nthe opposite position to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So whoever's keeping quiet is suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course, there's no guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:57.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But if you don't talk much,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:01.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,it'll seem like you're trying to monitor\Nthe others while staying out of their sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:05.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's what those around you\Nare likely to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Talking too much is dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but not talking enough is also dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:19.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go run for a bit to clear my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:21.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's a gym here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:23.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:27.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's a far cry from the one on the cargo ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:31.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Cargo ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:36.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I work on a cargo ship
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:39.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and got mixed up in all this\Nwhen I stopped by Liu-An.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Also, Comet's a stowaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:43.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stowaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:46.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey! You said you'd keep quiet about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here? I mean,\Nit's fine. It's just Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:54.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess. I don't have to worry\Nabout being caught here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Did you come here to exercise, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was just taking a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:02.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I figured I might run into you two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see you're as sharp as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:08.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry, could you hold this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:16.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I guess the cat's running, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.51,0:09:24.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:26.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:28.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Those... patterns on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:30.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's not a tattoo or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's a kind of microorganism—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:36.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,a symbiotic slime mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Symbiotic slime mold"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:43.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let me just warn you...\NBe careful when you touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It won't cause any trouble\Nwhen it's on her body,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but if it swallows you up, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So, on my planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:57.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,normal people can basically\Ndie within seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:00.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why we're left alone for the\Nfirst few years after we're born
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,while we and the mold get used to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:08.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It serves as a test\Nof who gets to continue living,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:13.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but it's also because of this mold that\Nwe can't usually travel off our planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:17.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why I helped smuggle her\Noff the planet as a stowaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you're\Nthe sole benefactor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:23.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to my contacts that you were\Nable to get that surgery with the cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:27.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. I'm crossing a\Ndangerous bridge myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I had to get something from you in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:31.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:36.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Not bad, but now that\Nwe're stuck in this mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'll have to stay like this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:40.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And I was so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:43.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Chipie's trying to become a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:50.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup. Apparently, that's his\Ndream. Isn't that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:52.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's not that weird, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do I think...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a bad idea, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little,\NI've been surrounded by cats,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:07.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,so that might be why I always\Nfelt so awkward being a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm currently trying to get\Nmyself accustomed to this cat's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:13.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:16.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:19.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,He saved up money for this\Nand really committed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you're supposed\Nto do with your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:26.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You ran away from home because you wanted\Nto be the captain of a spaceship one day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A spaceship captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:33.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup. Oh, but keep this a secret from\Neveryone else. It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:39.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes until warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:41.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess there really isn't that much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:44.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Later. Hopefully, we'll\Nall see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:45.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:50.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Comet, isn't your room that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:55.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're... so fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:00.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Fuzzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's hard to get a read on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You sorta seem like a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What? So you're suspecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm... I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:14.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this stuff is beyond me, so whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:23.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's filled a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:37.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:39.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So Racio was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:42.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. I cannot sense Racio's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it obvious that this would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They said entirely too much yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:51.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,meaning they made themselves\Nthe prime target for the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:53.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Would you like to start the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:55.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First, I have something to tell all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I kept quiet about this yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:09.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I have Doctor credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:12.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Doctor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:16.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It does appear that one person\Nhas been issued Doctor credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else also claim to be a Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:24.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It seems not. Okay, I'll continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, I checked Jina for a Gnosia\Nresponse after she was put into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The result was that she was clear.\NJina was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:36.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wait... What's this Doctor thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:39.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right. I guess I didn't explain that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:43.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Doctor is able to tell if the person
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:46.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,who was put into cold sleep the\Nday before is human or Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:49.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Engineer can check one living person,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and the Doctor can check one person\Nwho was put into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:58.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If we use the information available from both,\Nit should help us figure out the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:00.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:05.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But is there anything useful in\Nfinding out that Jina was human?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:10.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if it's useful, but it means we can\Nconfirm both Jina and Racio were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:16.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which would mean that there are\Ntwo Gnosia among the six of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:18.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And of those two,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:23.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,we know that one of them is among the two\Nclaiming Engineer—myself and Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:28.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which means the other must be\Namong the remaining four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:32.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's everything we currently know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:34.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:38.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella and Yuriko each have a\N50% chance of being Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:41.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,while the rest of us each have a 25% chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:42.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The odds are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:46.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So which should we prioritize in this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:49.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Didn't Racio mention yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that it'd be foolish to eliminate\Nthe ones claiming Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we shouldn't vote\Nfor those two today, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:58.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No, if we rule them out again today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Someone's going to end up in cold sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:03.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and someone's going to be attacked\Nby the Gnosia during the warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If that happens, there'll only be four left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:10.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then there'll be an equal amount of crew\Nand Gnosia, and the ship will be taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:19.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd like to make my report before we\Ngo any further, but is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. We forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When I conducted my check as Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I detected irregularities in\NChipie's dimensional waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Chipie is infected by the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:40.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then I shall make my report, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There were no traces of Gnosia in Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They are a truly insignificant existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:52.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This means one of them is lying and one\Nof them is telling the truth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:54.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:58.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But this also confirms\Nthat Setsu is the real Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:05.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's assume Yuriko is the real Engineer\Nand take her result as the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:07.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In that scenario, Setsu is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, I get that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:13.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And if we assume Stella is the real Engineer\Nand take her result as the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:15.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that means Chipie is a Gnosia—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and that the other Engineer,\NYuriko, is the other Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:22.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In which case, everyone\Nother than those two is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:25.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So in either scenario, Setsu is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:26.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:31.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So, Yuriko or Stella...\NWhich one is the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why did Yuriko check Setsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella checked Chipie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:40.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There has to be a reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:42.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Some kind of hint...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:45.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Chipie is infected by the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,think Yuriko is suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:57.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oho... Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:59.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If Yuriko and Stella were Gnosia,\Nhow would they try to trick us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:07.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuriko reported that Setsu was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But that was only after Setsu announced\Nthat they were the Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We can't rule out the possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:15.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that she used that situation to her\Nadvantage to make us believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:20.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Stella reported\Nthat Chipie was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:28.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,She's clearly trying to send a human into\Ncold sleep so she can take over the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:30.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Her intentions are crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Stella.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:36.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What made you decide to investigate Chipie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:38.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:43.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First, I decided against investigating Yuriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:45.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because even if she is a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:49.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,from my position, it would simply\Nbe confirming the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:55.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They've both come out and\Nclaimed to be the real Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:58.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,so of course they'd know the other is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So, why did you check me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:03.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well... No particular reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:06.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,See? She has no coherent answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:07.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I actually think that's the\Nproper reaction to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:13.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We humans don't have that much\Ninformation to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:18.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess you're no mere lamb after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to check Setsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:29.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They are the narrator who has been\Ndirecting the meetings on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:32.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I believe that's a sufficient reason\Nto investigate them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:36.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's true that the meetings\Ncould greatly change depending
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:38.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,on whether Setsu is a human or a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:43.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well? Where did all your spirit go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you going to raise the white flag\Nand surrender already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:50.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your reasoning is indeed sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But it's exactly as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your explanation was {\i1}too{\i0} complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:57.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,To me, it sounded like you had\Nprepared to use it from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:19:01.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,so that you could avoid the risk of\Nsingling yourself out as a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:03.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:05.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:08.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If Stella happened to be a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:12.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,saying that Chipie was a Gnosia\Nwould put her at risk, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:13.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:16.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't understand at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.59,0:19:22.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Declaring a Gnosia result means\Nmaking that person your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:26.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Since Stella said she was the Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,she's already made the other supposed\NEngineer, Yuriko, her enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:33.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,She's now made Chipie her enemy on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:35.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's only six of us left,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:38.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and she's done something that\Nguarantees two votes against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If Stella were a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:47.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine she'd take that much of a risk\Nwhen she could just lie all she wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:51.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:54.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You've averted your eyes from the truth\Nthat's right in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:57.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and blindly accepted an assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:20:01.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like an argument.\NIt just sounds like you're panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:07.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If we send a human into cold sleep right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:10.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,we'll have two Gnosia\Nand two humans tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:12.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,At that point, it's game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:20.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Voting has completed. Six valid votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.39,0:20:22.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The voting rate is 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The votes will now be tallied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuriko will be put into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You insignificant humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:51.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's no other way around it.\NI shall be frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:55.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you might as well tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:58.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whether we made the right decision or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:03.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You can find that out for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:11.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They say that in this vast universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:14.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,there are endless worlds\Nand endless possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Perhaps another version of you and another\Nversion of myself will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:21.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that may just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:32.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Chipie...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:40.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess this is checkmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're a sharp one, Setsu. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, when I check Yuriko\Nand determine that she was a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:50.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,it will confirm that Stella\Nis the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.09,0:21:52.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:55.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella's report that I'm a Gnosia
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:59.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,will also be confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.64,0:22:06.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I figured that I could just eliminate Setsu\Ntonight and it'd work out somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:10.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but that would ultimately just\Nlead to the same resolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:14.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As long as Yuri is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:15.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:21.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy. I didn't mean\Nto drag you into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:23.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Chipie...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:25.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's honestly pretty strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Eating, sleeping, and surviving\Nwas all I needed to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:29.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.97,0:22:34.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But even after becoming a Gnosia,\Nmy desire to be a cat didn't suddenly change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.43,0:22:40.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You guys win. You survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:42.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't have any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.89,0:22:48.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Chipie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:51.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:54.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:59.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No. Unlike you, I... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:03.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's not the end for me!\NEven if I mess up...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.51,0:23:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.97,0:23:09.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Uh, er... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.89,0:23:17.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Do your best," he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:19.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:32.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Gnosia presence has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:40.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We both still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:42.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:06.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.26,0:24:09.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Everyone's not gathered\Nin the main control room?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.97,0:24:25.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm?

